<title>CROATIA: Croatia July output down 1.4 pct, up 8 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Croatia July output down 1.4 pct, up 8 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State Bureau of Statistics issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT     JULY	JUNE     JULY 96</p>
<p> Month-on-month (pct)	    -1.4	 1.5	 -1.0</p>
<p> Year-on-year			 8.0	 8.4	  6.4</p>
<p> Index (base 1995)		109.2     110.7	101.1</p>
<p>NOTE -- January-July output rise was put at 5.2 percent compared to the same 1996 period.</p>
<p>-- Zagreb newsroom, + 385 1 455 7075</p>
</text>
